###############################################################################
# aspctt's Small RimWorld Patches - .gitignore for a set of RimWorld XML mods
###############################################################################

## Release builds
# Each mod's Release folder holds a copy of its Mod folder plus the readme,
# changelog, license and notice, ready to upload to the Steam Workshop.
# Regenerated on demand, so there is no reason to carry it, or any archive made
# from it, in history where it would bloat every clone.
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
Release/
Releases/
build/

## Game logs and runtime output, wherever they land
Player.log
Player-prev.log
*.log

## IDE / editor cruft
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.sublime-workspace
*.bak
*.old
*~

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

###############################################################################
# Local-only working material. NOT for publication.
#
# Each mod's Workshop description, Photoshop sources and other mods' files, kept
# next to the repository to write patches against. Other people's work under
# other people's terms; these mods ship none of it.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
###############################################################################
external-files/
